    "Debt payments count here because they are due every month, the same as rent. Anything you pay above the minimum comes out of what is left.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "تُحتسب أقساط الديون هنا لأنها مستحقة كل شهر، مثل الإيجار تمامًا. وأي مبلغ تدفعه فوق الحد الأدنى يأتي مما تبقّى."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Debt payments count here because they are due every month, the same as rent. Anything you pay above the minimum comes out of what is left."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le rate dei debiti contano qui perché sono dovute ogni mese, come l'affitto. Tutto ciò che paghi oltre il minimo esce da quello che resta."
          }
        }
      }
    },
