            "value": "Apri per progressi e pagamenti"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open the Plan tab and look at where you are on the route: what this month costs, what is left after it, and when the next debt clears. Then mark this done.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "افتح تبويب الخطة وانظر أين أنت على المسار: كم يكلّف هذا الشهر، وكم يتبقّى بعده، ومتى يُسدَّد الدين التالي. ثم أشِّر على إتمامها."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open the Plan tab and look at where you are on the route: what this month costs, what is left after it, and when the next debt clears. Then mark this done."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apri la scheda Piano e guarda a che punto sei del percorso: quanto costa questo mese, quanto resta dopo e quando si chiude il prossimo debito. Poi segnala come fatta."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open the plan and check where you stand.": {
