    "Record your income, expenses and debts, then get a monthly payoff plan that tells you exactly when you'll be done.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "سجّل دخلك ومصاريفك وديونك، ثم احصل على خطة سداد شهرية تعرف بالضبط متى تنتهي."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Registra entrate, spese e debiti e ottieni un piano mensile che ti dice esattamente quando finirai."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Recording this clears what they owe.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
