            "value": "The day before"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il giorno prima"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The document's details stay. Only the image is deleted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "تفاصيل المستند تبقى. تُحذف الصورة وحدها."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The document's details stay. Only the image is deleted."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I dati del documento restano. Viene eliminata solo l'immagine."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The document's own check digits confirm these were read correctly. Worth a glance anyway.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "أرقام التحقّق في المستند نفسه تؤكّد صحّة القراءة. تستحق نظرة سريعة على أي حال."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The document's own check digits confirm these were read correctly. Worth a glance anyway."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le cifre di controllo del documento confermano la lettura. Vale comunque un'occhiata."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The entries stay. Only the limit goes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "تبقى الحركات. يُحذف السقف وحده."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The entries stay. Only the limit goes."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le voci restano. Sparisce solo il limite."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The file is made on this device and shared only where you send it. A spreadsheet always exports the same columns, whichever layout you pick.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "يُنشأ الملف على هذا الجهاز ولا يُشارك إلا حيث ترسله أنت. ويُصدّر جدول البيانات الأعمدة نفسها دائمًا، أيًّا كان التنسيق الذي تختاره."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The file is made on this device and shared only where you send it. A spreadsheet always exports the same columns, whichever layout you pick."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il file viene creato su questo dispositivo e condiviso solo dove lo mandi tu. Il foglio di calcolo esporta sempre le stesse colonne, qualunque layout scegli."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The order I choose": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "بالترتيب الذي أختاره"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The order I choose"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L'ordine che scelgo io"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The route as a road, milestone by milestone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "المسار كطريق، محطةً بمحطة."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il percorso come una strada, traguardo dopo traguardo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The year at a glance, month by month.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "السنة في لمحة، شهرًا بشهر."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’anno a colpo d’occhio, mese per mese."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Then it's yours": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ثم يصبح لك"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Then it's yours"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Poi è tutto tuo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There is nothing left over to move this month.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "لا يوجد فائض لنقله هذا الشهر."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Questo mese non c’è un avanzo da spostare."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There isn't enough information to work out a new monthly payment — the debt needs an interest rate and a monthly payment that covers it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "لا توجد معلومات كافية لحساب قسط شهري جديد — يحتاج الدين إلى نسبة فائدة وقسط شهري يغطيها."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "There isn't enough information to work out a new monthly payment — the debt needs an interest rate and a monthly payment that covers it."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Non ci sono dati sufficienti per calcolare una nuova rata: il debito richiede un tasso di interesse e una rata che lo copra."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This cannot be undone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "لا يمكن التراجع عن هذا الإجراء."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L'operazione è irreversibile."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This debt is gone": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "هذا الدين لم يعد موجودًا"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This debt is gone"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Questo debito non c'è più"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This first person is you. Add the others afterwards.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "هذا الشخص الأول هو أنت. أضف الباقين لاحقًا."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This first person is you. Add the others afterwards."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Questa prima persona sei tu. Aggiungi gli altri dopo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This month": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "هذا الشهر"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This month"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Questo mese"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This payment is already as low as it can go — anything less would not cover the interest.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "هذه الدفعة عند أدنى حد ممكن — وأي مبلغ أقل لن يغطّي الفوائد."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Questa rata è già al minimo: qualcosa di meno non coprirebbe gli interessi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This plan isn't achievable": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "الخطة غير قابلة للتنفيذ"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il piano non è realizzabile"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This route doesn't reach the end": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "هذا المسار لا يصل إلى النهاية"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This route doesn't reach the end"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Questo percorso non arriva in fondo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tick each row as it is paid": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "أشِّر على كل صف عند سداده"
          }
        },
        "en": {
