    },
    "Your data is stored on this device only and is never sent to a server.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "بياناتك محفوظة على هذا الجهاز فقط، ولا تُرسل إلى أي خادم."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I dati sono salvati solo su questo dispositivo e non vengono mai inviati a un server."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your data stays on your device": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "بياناتك محفوظة على جهازك فقط"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I tuoi dati restano sul dispositivo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your income has to cover your expenses and your debt payments with something left over. Tap the big figure on Today to see the three numbers that make it up, and which one is eating the difference.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "يجب أن يغطي دخلك مصاريفك وأقساط ديونك مع بقاء فائض. اضغط على الرقم الكبير في «اليوم» لترى الأرقام الثلاثة التي تكوّنه، وأيّها يلتهم الفارق."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your income has to cover your expenses and your debt payments with something left over. Tap the big figure on Today to see the three numbers that make it up, and which one is eating the difference."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le tue entrate devono coprire spese e rate dei debiti lasciando qualcosa. Tocca la cifra grande su Oggi per vedere i tre numeri che la compongono, e quale si sta mangiando la differenza."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your income, expenses, debts and recorded entries will be permanently deleted and setup will start again. This cannot be undone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "سيُحذف دخلك ومصاريفك وديونك وحركاتك المسجلة نهائيًا، وتبدأ الإعداد من جديد. لا يمكن التراجع."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Entrate, spese, debiti e movimenti registrati saranno eliminati definitivamente e la configurazione ripartirà. L'operazione è irreversibile."
          }
        }
      }
    },
